# Optional. The Infrawrench repo is public, so release listings and downloads work
# unauthenticated; a token only raises the GitHub rate limit (60 requests per hour
# per IP without one). Leave it blank for local development. A token that GitHub
# rejects (expired, or a leftover placeholder) is ignored and the request is
# retried anonymously. Production sets a real fine-grained PAT as a Cloudflare secret.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
